        }
      }
    },
    "Heute vor einem Jahr": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On this day a year ago"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heute vor einem Monat": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On this day a month ago"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heute vor einer Woche": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On this day a week ago"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier siehst du eine Stunde lang, wo ich bin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here you can see where I am for the next hour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hilfe rufen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Call for help"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hol mich ab": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick me up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hoppla": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oops"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Höchsttempo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Top speed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich bin nur mitgefahren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I was only a passenger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich! Bin eh unterwegs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me! I'm out anyway."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Nebel teilst du keinen genauen Ort. Beende den Nebel zuerst, um einzuchecken.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In fog you don't share an exact location. End the fog first to check in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Apple Karten öffnen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open in Apple Maps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initialen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initials"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeder mit dem Link kann beitreten, bis er abläuft. Neue Mitglieder siehst du in der Mitgliederliste und kannst sie jederzeit entfernen. Entfernst du jemanden, werden alle offenen Einladungen ungültig.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone with the link can join until it expires. You see new members in the member list and can remove them at any time. Removing someone makes all open invites invalid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jemand": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jemanden einladen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite someone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kaffeepause": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coffee break"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Verlauf": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No history"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keine Verbindung zu iCloud. Bitte versuch es gleich noch einmal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No connection to iCloud. Please try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Klar, bin dabei!": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sure, count me in!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Klein": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Komm in meinen Leuchtturm %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Join my lighthouse %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kommt jemand an oder geht, bekommt der Leuchtturm Bescheid. Das prüft jedes iPhone selbst, kein Server kennt eure Orte. Vorschläge entstehen aus deinen Aufenthalten, die nur auf diesem iPhone gespeichert sind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When someone arrives or leaves, the lighthouse is told. Each iPhone checks this itself; no server knows your places. Suggestions come from your stays, which are stored only on this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kopieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lade Leute in einen Leuchtturm ein, dann erscheinen sie hier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite people to a lighthouse and they show up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lege zuerst einen Ort an, z. B. Zuhause.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a place first, e.g. Home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lege zuerst einen Ort an, z. B. die Schule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a place first, e.g. the school."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm an %@ übergeben": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hand the lighthouse over to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm auf Zeit · endet %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temporary lighthouse · ends %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm beitreten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Join lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm für alle löschen?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete lighthouse for everyone?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm gründen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm ist kein Notrufdienst. In Lebensgefahr ruf direkt die 112 an.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leuchtturm is not an emergency service. If a life is in danger, call 112 directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm löschen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm speichert in iCloud (Apple). Namen von Leuchttürmen und Personen sowie Standorte werden vorher auf dem iPhone verschlüsselt, Apple kann sie nicht lesen. Apple sieht aber, welche iCloud-Konten zusammen in einem Leuchtturm sind und wann Daten geschrieben werden. Die Daten liegen in Apples Rechenzentren, nicht zwingend in der EU. Die Karte selbst kommt von Apple Karten: Beim Laden sieht Apple, welchen Kartenausschnitt du ansiehst, aber nicht, wer wo ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leuchtturm stores data in iCloud (Apple). Names of lighthouses and people and locations are encrypted on the iPhone first; Apple cannot read them. Apple does see which iCloud accounts are in a lighthouse together and when data is written. The data is in Apple's data centers, not necessarily in the EU. The map itself comes from Apple Maps: when it loads, Apple sees which map area you look at, but not who is where."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm umbenennen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rename lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm verlassen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm verlassen?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave lighthouse?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm verwalten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manage lighthouse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leuchtturm wählen": {
